                                                "sense_id": "469fff5e-ac9c-3585-9364-df2b9dd3bc63",
                                                "text": "And thus did the trumpets sound one-and-twenty blasts every day; […] three soundings at the three pausings of the music, […]"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "0976e5e4-7666-4abe-8163-b31affb58421",
                                                "sense_id": "469fff5e-ac9c-3585-9364-df2b9dd3bc63",
                                                "text": "In the course of his soundings, Sir Herbert Walker had heard favourable reports of O.V.S. Bulleid, currently Principal Assistant to Gresley on the LNER."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
