                                                "sense_id": "36026301-279b-383e-96ed-561e7f69ece9",
                                                "text": "Little Mary was sounding very sleepy, so I tucked her in bed."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "5e576c8d-684f-4602-a1f7-6f33df59d06e",
                                                "sense_id": "36026301-279b-383e-96ed-561e7f69ece9",
                                                "text": "\"Assist\"'s sense ‘to be present (at a ceremony, entertainment, etc.)’, now uncommon and sounding affected, is a Gallicism."
